"Connie Hatcher's Chicago home is where Alden lived with his aunt from age eleven."
"The living room carpet had mysterious stains; the stove was sketchy."
"Alden's bedroom there has a window; it went unused after he left."
"Connie kept magazine piles from checkout lines and once a roach trap and one beer in the fridge."
"Rent there is less than the cost of one System call from the Triplanets."
"After Alden went missing, Connie ripped up the stained hall carpet for vinyl and mops twice a week."
"Wummy, Alden's stuffed wombat, sat on Connie's dresser while he was gone."
"In the Matadero crisis, Healer Rynez-yt came to its door to evacuate Connie at Alden's request."
